<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Site Under Maintenance</title>
    <style>
        /* Basic Reset and Fonts */
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol";
            background-color: #f7f9fc;
            color: #333;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }

        /* Container for content */
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        /* Header and Text Styles */
        h1 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 0.5em;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1.1em;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #7f8c8d;
            margin-bottom: 2em;
        }

        /* Simple Loading Animation (Spinning Cog) */
        .spinner {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            border: 5px solid #ecf0f1;
            border-top: 5px solid #3498db;
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: spin 1.5s linear infinite;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            margin-top: 25px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #bdc3c7;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Wise Answers Freight Estimator</h1>

        <div class="spinner"></div>

        <h1>System Update In Progress</h1>

        <p>We are currently performing a scheduled update to bring you a better experience.</p>

        <p>The site is expected to be back online in just **a few minutes**.</p>

        <p>Thank you for your patience!</p>

        <div class="footer">
            Wise Business Forms
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>